{
  "body0": "The war is on, whatever the bulletins call it. The fight belongs to the first-wave ghost colony and Ceibo's Breach IV; the bleeding is done at Ceibo's Breach IV Dome. Every shift change, someone repaints the boundary line around the chiral volatile reservoirs a hand-width farther out. Legal filings over Ceibo's Breach IV Dome arrive faster than the courts can docket them. Brothers of Choir sharpens, Pale Saint Pact braces, and Carrion Wake learns to sleep in a pressure suit. The fuse is lit at both ends and burning politely. Cargo manifests between the two camps now travel with notarized seals nobody used to bother with. When Carrion Wake and Vow-Breaker Wake finally close, it will be Brothers of Choir standing between them, holding the freight surcharge that lands on them no matter who wins. For now the knives stay sheathed, and the sheaths get oiled nightly. Ceibo's Breach IV was here first, and everything about Ceibo's Breach IV Dome apologizes for it.",
